Z||000001||Tigger||01-25-2001||09:05 AM||||I heard a Motel 6 commercial over the radio this morning...<P>"...and we'll leave the light on for you.  Offer not valid in California."<P>From blurbs of what I've heard on the news, there's talk that the energy problem might have been caused by government deregulation, go figure.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>I wonder if there's evidence that California will finally fall into the ocean soon, and the problem will just go away? j/k<P>||||reg||1
